SSAnne_Deck_Text_ShipDepartingSoon::
    .string "The party's over.\n"
    .string "The ship will be departing soon.$"

SSAnne_Deck_Text_ScrubbingDecksHardWork::
    .string "Whew!\n"
    .string "Scrubbing decks is hard work!$"

SSAnne_Deck_Text_FeelSeasick::
    .string "Urf… I feel ill…\p"
    .string "I got seasick, so I stepped out to\n"
    .string "get some air…$"

SSAnne_Deck_Text_EdmondExplanation::
    .string "Out on the high seas, researchers use\n"
    .string "specialized Research Balls!\p"
    .string "They are designed to safely contain wild\n"
    .string "specimens for scientific observation.\p"
    .string "However, wild POKéMON held inside don't\n"
    .string "become loyal to you like partners do.\p"
    .string "If you try to open a Research Ball in\n"
    .string "the field without specialized laboratory\l"
    .string "equipment, the POKéMON will flee!\p"
    .string "Also, remember that electronic storage\n"
    .string "boxes don't exist in this era.\p"
    .string "Your boxed POKéMON are cared for at\n"
    .string "Mr. Fuji's Sanctuary in Lavender Town!$"

SSAnne_Deck_Text_TrevorExplanation::
    .string "Ahoy, Samuel! The fresh sea air does\n"
    .string "wonders for the spirit, doesn't it?\p"
    .string "The ship has officially docked at\n"
    .string "Vermilion City port!\p"
    .string "If you haven't yet, make sure you visit\n"
    .string "Professor Arbor in Room 6 downstairs\l"
    .string "to choose your partner POKéMON!\p"
    .string "Once you're all set, head through the\n"
    .string "main exit doors on 1F to disembark.\p"
    .string "Good luck on your research journey!$"

